  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pad see ew serves 2 and takes about 20 minutes. The dish is built around "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "flat rice noodles",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "rice-noodles-flat"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " tossed in a wok with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dark soy sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soy-sauce-dark"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "oyster sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "oyster-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The high heat and dark sauce give the noodles their characteristic smoky colour and sweetness. Chinese broccoli is traditional; beansprouts work well as a substitute."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The key to pad see ew is very high heat and patience. Let the noodles sit undisturbed for 30 seconds at a time so they get char on the edges rather than steaming."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
